# PD2 Build & Dev Tooling

Windows x86_64, MSYS2 MinGW, CMake + Ninja, PowerShell 5.1+.

## Read first (before behavioral changes)

- `devtools/build-headless.ps1`
- `context/procedures.md` "Build tool architecture" section (build tool sync rules)
- `context/pillars/build-dev-tooling.md` (live state of the build pillar)
- `CLAUDE.md` (build environment)

## Rules

- **Sync:** CMake configure flags and version injection must match between `devtools/build-headless.ps1` and Dev Window build steps (`Get-BuildSteps` in `devtools/dev-window-v2/dev-window-v2.ps1` or `devtools/_dev-window.ps1`). Change both or neither.
- **Join-Path (PS 5.1):** Only two arguments per call; nest for more segments. Never `Join-Path $a $b $c`.
- **`.ps1` source:** ASCII hyphens and straight quotes only (no em dash U+2014, curly quotes, decorative Unicode). Prefer UTF-8 with BOM only if non-ASCII is required.
- **Git:** No destructive git unless the user explicitly asks.
- **Verify:** After build-script edits, point to the documented flow (`build-headless.ps1` / Ninja per repo docs), not ad-hoc CMake from a worktree.

## Scope

In scope: `devtools/`, root `CMakeLists.txt` when it affects version or build wiring, Dev Window scripts. Out of scope: gameplay C/C++ except includes or paths required for the build.
